{"text":"Really, that period is marked by a period of low economic growth to such an extent that international institutions such as the IMF and the World Bank, but also corporations such as McKinsey, had already said after the global financial crisis that the world economy would never again see the rates of growth that it had seen before the financial crisis in the next 50 years, or I should say subsequent 50 years. To be absolutely clear, the period between 1950 and 2008, which had seen not just enormous economic success across both developed and developing countries, but had posted in some cases double digit economic growth, would not occur again.","words":[{"text":"Really","start":0.0,"end":0.56,"punct":","},{"text":"that","start":0.86,"end":0.9},{"text":"period","start":0.9,"end":1.4},{"text":"is","start":1.4,"end":1.74},{"text":"marked","start":1.74,"end":2.08},{"text":"by","start":2.08,"end":2.42},{"text":"a","start":2.42,"end":2.54},{"text":"period","start":2.54,"end":2.76},{"text":"of","start":2.76,"end":2.96},{"text":"low","start":2.96,"end":3.24},{"text":"economic","start":3.24,"end":3.76},{"text":"growth","start":3.76,"end":4.28},{"text":"to","start":4.28,"end":4.86},{"text":"such","start":4.86,"end":5.12},{"text":"an","start":5.12,"end":5.28},{"text":"extent","start":5.28,"end":5.78},{"text":"that","start":5.78,"end":6.56},{"text":"international","start":6.56,"end":6.96},{"text":"institutions","start":6.96,"end":7.82},{"text":"such","start":7.82,"end":8.24},{"text":"as","start":8.24,"end":8.48},{"text":"the","start":8.48,"end":8.58},{"text":"IMF","start":8.58,"end":9.0},{"text":"and","start":9.0,"end":9.5},{"text":"the","start":9.5,"end":9.62},{"text":"World","start":9.62,"end":9.82},{"text":"Bank","start":9.82,"end":10.28,"punct":","},{"text":"but","start":10.74,"end":10.92},{"text":"also","start":10.92,"end":11.42},{"text":"corporations","start":11.42,"end":11.98},{"text":"such","start":11.98,"end":12.44},{"text":"as","start":12.44,"end":12.66},{"text"